<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 21.53 pct, 3-mo 21.35 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 21.53 pct, 3-mo 21.35 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) dipped for both the one-month and the three-month maturities, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 21.53 percent, down 0.01, while the three-month rate was fixed at 21.35 percent, down from 0.03.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
